      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ。\r\n造船所に行けば会えると思うぜ。\r\nリドっていう、ちょっと変わった人だよ。",
        "official_en": "Yep! There’s someone at the shipyard who does just that. Her name’s Lid. A bit of an oddball, though.",
        "real_en": null
      },
